	(text "FujiNet-INTV-Rev0 — all-in-one Intellivision FujiNet cartridge.\nAdapts the PiNTY CARD (oshwlab.com/yannick.erb/intv-pirto-hb, CERN-OHL-W-2.0)\n+ ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 (fujiversal-intv) + CP2102N USB-C UART/flash port.\nRP2354A runs the fujicard Minty fork; ESP32<->RP link is native USB (S3 host).\nEdge map validated against PiNTY gerbers; ECS audio inject at edge pin 6 (DNP RC)."
